# OnionRoute Lite torrc Template
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is the base template. The app generates the final torrc
# by appending bridge configuration lines based on user settings.
#
# Design principles:
# - AvoidDiskWrites: Minimize flash storage wear on device
# - SafeSocks: Never allow non-anonymous SOCKS connections
# - Minimal guards: Faster on mobile networks
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Network Ports ────────────────────────────────────────────
SocksPort 9050
SocksListenAddress 127.0.0.1
HTTPTunnelPort 8118
DNSPort 5400
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1

# ── Security ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
AvoidDiskWrites 1
SafeSocks 1
TestSocks 1
WarnPlaintextPorts 23,109,110,143,25
RejectPlaintextPorts 21,109,110,143,25

# ── Performance (Mobile-Optimized) ───────────────────────────
NumEntryGuards 2
NumDirectoryGuards 2
UseEntryGuards 1
LearnCircuitBuildTimeout 1
CircuitBuildTimeout 60

# ── Logging ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
Log notice stderr

# ── Bridge Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────
# (Appended programmatically based on user toggle settings)
# UseBridges 1
# ClientTransportPlugin snowflake exec /path/to/snowflake-client ...
# ClientTransportPlugin obfs4 exec /path/to/obfs4proxy
# Bridge snowflake ...
# Bridge obfs4 ...
